flowchart TD
    A[ATDTower::AttackTick] --> B[SphereComponent::GetOverlappingActors]
    B --> C[GetClosestEnemyInRange]
    C -->|No target| D[return]
    C -->|Target found| E[Target->TakeDamage]
    E --> F[ATDEnemy::TakeDamage override]
    F --> G[Super::TakeDamage]
    F --> H[TDHealthComponent::TakeDamage]
    H --> I{CurrentHealth <= 0?}
    I -->|No| J[done]
    I -->|Yes| K[OnDeath]
    K --> L[GetPlayerCharacter -> AddGold]
    L --> M[Enemy->HandleDestroy]
